  "details": "Have a 2nd account to test this on between PC and Android. The mic works on VRC mobile while speaking like I'm speaking to others on phone call by speaker phone. I have to speak at a normal pace, and not so fast. Tested in PS Home Log Cabin, Popcorn Palace, and Black Cat. And one instance of 25+ players, with most as bots, and friends in avatars, fallback, imposter. Mic will break when speaking too close, and when speaking too fast. Phone used: Samsung Galaxy S23 FE, Android 14, 8 GB RAM.",
